## Key Patterns

**Use StringEnum for string parameters** (required for Google API compatibility): ```typescript import { StringEnum } from "@earendil-works/pi-ai"; // Good action: StringEnum(["list", "add"] as const)

// Bad - doesn't work with Google action: Type.Union([Type.Literal("list"), Type.Literal("add")]) ```

