## Override Existing Provider

The simplest use case: redirect an existing provider through a proxy.

```typescript // All Anthropic requests now go through your proxy pi.registerProvider("anthropic", { baseUrl: "https://proxy.example.com" });

// Add custom headers to OpenAI requests pi.registerProvider("openai", { headers: { "X-Custom-Header": "value" } });

// Both baseUrl and headers pi.registerProvider("google", { baseUrl: "https://ai-gateway.corp.com/google", headers: { "X-Corp-Auth": "$CORP_AUTH_TOKEN" // env var or literal } }); ```

